[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18183.03, "timestamp": "05:03:03", "text": "等等，我现在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18184.31, "timestamp": "05:03:04", "text": "开始了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18207.23, "timestamp": "05:03:27", "text": "嘿，那是南边的装卸货平台。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18214.39, "timestamp": "05:03:34", "text": "是的。是的。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18216.31, "timestamp": "05:03:36", "text": "哪怕只是建一堵墙之类的，也会产生很大的影响。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18217.39, "timestamp": "05:03:37", "text": "哦，好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18218.75, "timestamp": "05:03:38", "text": "我同意。一个，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18220.868, "timestamp": "05:03:40", "text": "这里有迫击炮。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18223.548, "timestamp": "05:03:43", "text": "在哪里？"}]